{"timestamp": 1779358836.9910011, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 22, "data": {"caller": "player_3", "reason": "Diana reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "security", "victim_name": "Eve"}, {"room": "electrical", "victim_name": "Frank"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779358836.9916549, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 22, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779358852.696778, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 22, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I found Eve\u2019s body in Security, right on top of me when I entered from Navigation, so I reported immediately. Frank is also dead, apparently in Electrical, but I did not personally see that body.\n\nMy route was: Cafeteria \u2192 Oxygen \u2192 Upper Engine \u2192 Lower Engine \u2192 Storage \u2192 Navigation \u2192 Security.  \nI saw Frank in Oxygen around tick 3, then he left toward Upper Engine. I saw him again in Lower Engine around ticks 9-10. Later I saw Alice in Storage around ticks 14-16. I didn\u2019t see anyone else near Security when I found Eve.\n\nNo hard accusation from me yet, but Frank ending up dead in Electrical means whoever killed him likely had access around that side after I last saw him in Lower Engine. Eve was in Security when I arrived, and I didn\u2019t see anyone running away."}}
{"timestamp": 1779358879.525813, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 22, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I started in Weapons, then went Security \u2192 Navigation \u2192 Storage \u2192 Lower Engine.  \n\nIn Security around tick 5, I saw Charlie there. I did **not** see Eve\u2019s body at that time, so Security was clear then from what I could see. After that I went through Navigation and into Storage. I saw Diana in Storage around ticks 14-16, and I specifically saw her enter Storage from Lower Engine at tick 14, which lines up with her route before she says she went Navigation \u2192 Security and found Eve.\n\nI don\u2019t have info on Frank in Electrical because I never went there. Main thing from me is: Charlie was the only person I saw in Security earlier, but it was early, so not a hard accuse. I\u2019d like to hear Charlie\u2019s exact route after Security, and Bob\u2019s route too since I didn\u2019t see Bob at all."}}
{"timestamp": 1779358900.3130088, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 22, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "My route was Navigation \u2192 Security \u2192 Weapons \u2192 Cafeteria \u2192 Oxygen \u2192 Upper Engine.\n\nI was in Security early, and Alice came in from Weapons around tick 4. She left Security toward Navigation around tick 5. Security was clear when I was there \u2014 no body.\n\nAfter that I went to Weapons, and I saw Eve alive there around ticks 8-10. I also saw Eve enter Weapons from Cafeteria around tick 7. So Eve was definitely alive after the early Security timing Alice mentioned.\n\nI did not see Frank at all this round, and I never went Electrical.\n\nMain thing: if Eve ended up dead in Security, she must have gone from Weapons toward Security sometime after I last saw her. I don\u2019t have a hard accuse, but Bob is the big missing piece right now since I didn\u2019t see Bob at all, and Alice also didn\u2019t see Bob. Bob needs to give a clear route, especially around Security/Electrical."}}
{"timestamp": 1779358915.979923, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 22, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "Alright, here's my route \u2014 I'll be straightforward because I know I'm the missing piece for everyone.\n\nElectrical \u2192 Medbay \u2192 Electrical \u2192 Security \u2192 Weapons \u2192 Cafeteria \u2192 Medbay \u2192 Electrical.\n\nI started in Electrical, popped into Medbay early (saw Eve there around ticks 3-4), went back through Electrical, then up to Security around tick 11 \u2014 and Eve was alive in Security when I was there. I didn't see a body. From there I went Weapons \u2192 Cafeteria \u2192 Medbay, and ended back in Electrical at the end where I saw Frank at tick 20.\n\nSo a few things stand out to me:\n\n1. Frank being dead in Electrical \u2014 I was in Electrical at tick 20 and Frank was alive there. I left and the meeting got called shortly after. Whoever else came into Electrical after me is the killer. That's a tight window.\n\n2. Charlie says he saw Eve enter Weapons from Cafeteria around tick 7 and saw her alive in Weapons ticks 8-10. I saw Eve alive in Security at tick 11. That lines up \u2014 Eve went Weapons \u2192 Security. So someone killed her in Security after tick 11.\n\n3. Diana said she entered Security from Navigation and found Eve's body. Alice confirms Diana came from Storage \u2192 Navigation \u2192 Security. That fits.\n\nThe thing that bugs me: Charlie's route ends Cafeteria \u2192 Oxygen \u2192 Upper Engine. That keeps him far from both bodies, which is convenient. But I don't have a hard read.\n\nI'm honestly most worried about whoever was near Electrical around tick 20. I was there and left \u2014 if anyone can place themselves near Electrical late, speak up. Otherwise I lean skip or soft vote Charlie since his route is the cleanest-but-unverifiable."}}
{"timestamp": 1779358938.816571, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 22, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "Bob, you\u2019re the only person placing yourself at both relevant spots: Security with Eve after Charlie saw her alive, and Electrical with Frank right before he died. Frank being \u201calive at tick 20\u201d is only from you, and then Frank ends up dead in Electrical.\n\nAlice and I can confirm each other in Storage around 14-16, and my route to Navigation then Security lines up. Charlie\u2019s route is less confirmed late, but he at least has a consistent Eve timing in Weapons.\n\nTo me, Bob is the strongest suspect here because he has opportunity for both kills and is last known near both victims."}}
{"timestamp": 1779358962.981846, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 22, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I agree with Diana here. From my side, the part I can confirm is Diana was with me in Storage around 14-16, and I saw her come in from Lower Engine, so her route toward Navigation and then Security makes sense.\n\nBob is the only one whose story puts him with both victims shortly before they died: Eve alive in Security at tick 11, then Frank alive in Electrical at tick 20. Both of those \u201clast seen alive\u201d timings are only coming from Bob, and both bodies end up exactly where he says he was.\n\nCharlie was in Security early with me, but Security was clear then, and Charlie\u2019s Eve-in-Weapons timing lines up with Eve later moving toward Security. I don\u2019t think that\u2019s as suspicious as Bob being at both kill locations.\n\nI\u2019m leaning Bob pretty strongly."}}
{"timestamp": 1779358978.889035, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 22, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I agree with Diana and Alice: Bob is the strongest suspect.\n\nTo restate my info: I was in Security early with Alice, and it was clear. Alice came from Weapons around tick 4 and left to Navigation around tick 5. Later I saw Eve alive in Weapons at ticks 8-10 after she entered from Cafeteria at tick 7, so Eve was alive well after early Security.\n\nBob\u2019s story is the problem: he says he saw Eve alive in Security at tick 11, and then Eve dies in Security. He also says he saw Frank alive in Electrical at tick 20, and Frank dies in Electrical. That makes Bob the last known person with both victims, at both body locations.\n\nMy late route was Cafeteria \u2192 Oxygen \u2192 Upper Engine, nowhere near Security or Electrical at the end. Alice and Diana also have some confirmation around Storage. Bob is the only one connecting both kills, so I\u2019m voting Bob."}}
{"timestamp": 1779359056.4770749, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 22, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "Look, I hear all of you, and I get why I look like the easy target \u2014 I'm the one who actually gave you timings on both victims. But think about what that means: a Duck wouldn't volunteer \"I saw Eve alive in Security at tick 11\" and \"I saw Frank alive in Electrical at tick 20\" if those were the kill windows. That's me handing you a noose. A killer would scrub those locations from their route entirely.\n\nHere's the part nobody's addressing: Charlie, you said Eve entered Weapons from Cafeteria at tick 7 and you were in Weapons ticks 8-10. I was in Weapons right after Security \u2014 around tick 12-13. Weapons was empty when I got there. So you left Weapons before me, which fits your route to Cafeteria \u2192 Oxygen \u2192 Upper Engine. Fine.\n\nBut Diana \u2014 you say you went Storage \u2192 Navigation \u2192 Security and found Eve. Alice confirms you in Storage 14-16. Navigation to Security is 2 ticks. That puts you arriving in Security around tick 18-19. Eve was alive there at tick 11. That's a SEVEN tick gap where anyone could have killed her \u2014 including Diana herself arriving and reporting instantly to clear her name.\n\nAnd Frank in Electrical \u2014 I left Electrical right after seeing him. Diana, where exactly were you between Security and calling the meeting? Because reporting Eve doesn't account for Frank dying in Electrical on the opposite side of the map.\n\nI'm not the kill \u2014 but if I'm wrong about Diana, then we have a problem next round. I'm voting Diana."}}
